<title>USA: Superior trying to gain mkt share - Barron's.</title>
<headline>Superior trying to gain mkt share - Barron's.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Superior Industries International Inc is trying to increase its market share for aluminum wheels, an effort that might help the price of its stock recover from a fall, the weekly financial tabloid Barron's said.</p>
<p>&quot;Lately, the shares have come down with the growth rate. But the company is pushing hard to get back up to speed and, at current depressed levels, the stock has its own appeal,&quot; it said in its March 3 edition.</p>
</text>
